# ===================================================
# Rule Name:      Direct / Overseas Direct Rules
# Target Region:  Malaysia / Non-GFW Environments
# Policy:         Force DIRECT for all domains and IP-ASNs
# Services:       Apple / Google / Cloudflare / AWS / GitHub / Telegram / Facebook / Wahtsapp
# ===================================================
# Apple
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, icloud-content.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, gateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, metrics.icloud.com
IP-ASN, 714

# Google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com.my
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gmail.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleusercontent.com
IP-ASN,15169

# Cloudflare
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflareinsights.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ocsp.digicert.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,one.one.one.one
IP-ASN,13335

# AWS
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonaws.com
IP-ASN,16509

# GitHub
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,github.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubusercontent.com
IP-ASN,8075

# Telegram
IP-ASN, 44907, no-resolve
IP-ASN, 62014, no-resolve
IP-ASN, 59930, no-resolve
IP-ASN, 62041, no-resolve
IP-ASN, 211157, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 5.28.192.0/18, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 109.239.140.0/24, no-resolve

# Meta Services (Facebook & WhatsApp)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.net
IP-ASN,32934



